 "summary": "The Navien Modbus/BACnet gateway reads an NFB-C boiler over Modbus RTU and presents it as a BACnet IP or BACnet MS/TP device (or Modbus TCP). The single-boiler profile gives on/off and enable commands, space-heat and DHW setpoints, temperatures, pump and thermostat states, error codes and run counters.",
